|location=[[Patients' Lounge]]
|fourth_slot_aspects=[[Reels of Film|Reel of Film]]
|fifth_slot_aspects=[[Memory]]}}
{{Quote|Governor Collers had this installed in the 20s, as a treat for prisoners allowed to recover in the infirmary. Or so he said. Rumour had it he was a secret Keaton fan, and didn't want to motor all the way up to Exeter to see the latest feature.}}
__NOTOC__<br/>The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Workstation]] located in the [[Patients' Lounge]]. It's the only Workstation that can be used to master [[Reels of Film]].

