<br/>A '''Memory''' is a type of card that can be used to add [[Principles]] to an action. Memories disappear at dawn unless they are [[Persistent]] or are a part of the ongoing process that already took them in. Any action that uses a memory will consume it, even if the memory is persistent.

There is a 14% chance of a Memory [[Opportunity]] when attempting to master a book without enough of the required [[Principles|principle]].

