Generates [[Memory: Sight]].

== Trivia ==
This painting is based on the Mansus screen from ''Cultist Simulator,'' even having the paths from the different Gates to their alternate options (such as from Way: Through the Stag Door, to The Ascent of Knives and The Painted River) intact. Which does mean that this ''is,'' in fact, ''the'' best-known depiction of the House of the Sun.
