__NOTOC__<br>'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a location in [[Brancrug Village]], available after unlocking the village at the [[The Beginning|start of the game]]. It is home to [[The Midwife|Mrs Kille]] and [[The Coffinmaker|Mr Kille]], both of whom can be hired as [[Assistants]] by using an [[Element of the Soul]] with {{Lore|Grail}} or {{Lore|Winter}}, respectively.

