The Blacksmith.text:
{{PersonInfobox
|title1=Denzil Smith
|image1=The_Blacksmith.png
|aspects=[[Assistance]], [[An Introduction]]
|fee=12p
|principles={{Lore|Edge|2}}, {{Lore|Forge|2}}}}
{{quote|Denzil Smith, strong as oak, blackened by smoke. He will never surpass his father, and he is no longer a soldier. But he still has his craft.}}
__NOTOC__<br/>'''The Blacksmith''' is an inhabitant of [[Brancrug Village]], and the [[Librarians|Librarian's]] acquaintance if [[Mettle]] is chosen in [[The Beginning]].

For [[Pence|a Shilling]] (or free if he is your acquaintance), Denzil can be hired as an [[Assistants|Assistant]]. His [[Principles]] are {{Lore|Edge|2}} and {{Lore|Forge|2}}. Unlike other Assistants, Denzil can make use of [[Metal]].

In the ''[[House of Light]]'' DLC, he can be invited to a [[Salon]] once per [[Season]]. His card will remain in the Sundries tab until used for a Salon, but he can still be hired and used to unlock rooms as usual.

==Introduction==
===An Old Friend's Address===
{{quote|Denzil is the blacksmith of Brancrug Village. I remember him from the War. If he remembers me, I can find shelter beneath his roof - <b>once I've reached Brancrug Village</b>.}}
<br/>If Denzil is the Librarian's acquaintance, he will provide shelter and warmth following the storm, and will always offer his services for free.

{{Quote|Denzil looms in the fire-bright doorway. 'You? Here? How?'<br/><br/>I stagger into the smithy, out of the cold at last. Without another word, Denzil hands me a blanket and sets about stoking the fire: the warmest welcome of which he is capable.<br/><br/>Denzil only has the one bed, but he can offer me a straw mattress in the smithy. It's smoky, but the warmth is very welcome.<br/><br/>Denzil pauses at the door as I wish him goodnight. 'Sun'll be back,' he observes. 'Always do. Used to say that in the War, dint we?' The words linger as he clumps up the passage. The lamp-flame flickers red, gold, red.}}

==The Smithy [Locked]==
{{quote|Denzil Smith has more work than he needs, and he rarely opens his door to strangers.}}
Unlocking [[The Smithy]] requires [[An Introduction]], a mutual acquaintance with {{Lore|Edge}}, {{Lore|Forge}}, or {{Lore|Heart}}, someone in a similar trade, or someone who can appeal to his secret passion for saffron cake.

After unlocking The Smithy, Denzil can be hired as an [[Assistants|Assistant]].

