{{quote|A musician is entertaining the patrons of the Sweet Bones for pennies... not very many pennies. He'd jump at a better-paid opportunity.}}
<br/>'''Passing By: a Travelling Musician''' can be encountered at [[The Sweet Bones]] in any [[Season]] except [[Numa]] by using an [[Elements of the Soul|Element of the Soul]] and any amount of [[Pence]].
{{quote|<nowiki/>'I'm just some irritating, lying, ginger kid from Cornwall who should have been locked up [...] I just managed to escape and blag it into music.'|Richard James}}
The Travelling Musician can be hired for 24 [[Pence]]. His [[Principles]] are {{Lore|Nectar|4}}, {{Lore|Rose|4}}, and {{Lore|Sky|4}}.

Like all [[Assistants]], his Principles can be increased by [[Assistants#Increasing Aspects|Collaborating]].

